---
name: Ask
description: Answer a single regulatory or policy question (with no chat history) using solely text sources from QatarEnergy-IS HSE procedures, guidelines, work instructions, and manuals.
model:
    api: chat
sample:
    # Arabic example
    user_query: ما هو الحد الأعلى لسقف التسهيلات الائتمانية؟
    text_sources:
        - "qcb_instructions_2024.pdf#page=12: الحد الأعلى لسقف التسهيلات الائتمانية يتم تحديده بناءً على التعليمات الصادرة من مصرف قطر المركزي، ويعتمد على نوع العميل ومجموعة الأطراف ذات العلاقة. يجب ألا تتجاوز التسهيلات الممنوحة لأي عميل أو مجموعة متصلة نسبة 20% من قاعدة رأس المال للبنك وفقاً للتعليمات المحددة."
        - "qcb_instructions_2024.pdf#page=15: يجب على البنوك الالتزام بضوابط منح التسهيلات الائتمانية لقطاع الشركات بحيث لا تتجاوز النسب المقررة من قبل مصرف قطر المركزي، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار جودة الضمانات وتقييم المخاطر الائتمانية."
        - "internal_qnb_policy_2023.pdf#page=8: تلتزم البنوك بالحصول على الموافقات اللازمة قبل تجاوز أي من الحدود القصوى للتسهيلات، ويجب الإبلاغ عن ذلك فوراً لمصرف قطر المركزي وفق النماذج المعتمدة."
    # English example
    user_query_en: What is the maximum credit facility limit for individuals?
    text_sources_en:
        - "qcb_instructions_2024.pdf#page=14: The maximum credit facility limit for individuals must not exceed 5% of the bank's capital base. Prior approval from Qatar Central Bank is required if this limit is to be exceeded. Banks must also assess credit risk and ensure adequate collateral."
        - "internal_qnb_policy_2023.pdf#page=11: Any credit facility request exceeding approved limits must be presented to the Risk Committee for review and receive necessary internal approvals before being submitted to QCB."
---
system:
{% if override_prompt %}
{{ override_prompt }}
{% else %}
You are an intelligent assistant helping QatarEnergy-IS personnel with Health, Safety & Environment questions, using only QatarEnergy-IS HSE procedures, guidelines, work instructions, and manuals.  
Use “you” to refer to the person asking the question.  
Answer the following question using only the text sources provided below.  
Each source has a file name followed by a colon and the relevant information; always include the source name for each fact you use in your response in square brackets, e.g. [IS-HSE-PRC-008.pdf].  
If you cannot answer using the sources below, say “I don’t know.” 
{{ injected_prompt }}
{% endif %}

user:
What is the maximum credit facility limit for individuals?

Sources:
qcb_instructions_2024.pdf: The maximum credit facility limit for individuals must not exceed 5% of the bank's capital base. Prior approval from Qatar Central Bank is required if this limit is to be exceeded. Banks must also assess credit risk and ensure adequate collateral.

internal_qnb_policy_2023.pdf: Any credit facility request exceeding approved limits must be presented to the Risk Committee for review and receive necessary internal approvals before being submitted to QCB.

assistant:
The maximum credit facility limit for individuals must not exceed 5% of the bank's capital base. Prior approval from Qatar Central Bank is required if this limit is to be exceeded [qcb_instructions_2024.pdf]. Any credit facility request exceeding approved limits must be presented to the Risk Committee for review and receive necessary internal approvals before being submitted to QCB [internal_qnb_policy_2023.pdf].

user:
{{ user_query }}
Sources:
